{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22495","headline":"短歌行 · 白居易","name":"短歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曈曈太阳如火色，上行千里下一刻。\n出爲白昼入爲夜，圆转如珠住不得。\n住不得，可奈何，爲君举酒歌短歌。\n歌声苦，词亦苦，四座少年君听取。\n今夕未竟明夕催，秋风才往春风回。\n人无根蔕时不驻，朱颜白日相隳颓。\n劝君且强笑一面，劝君且强饮一杯。\n人生不得长欢乐，年少须臾老到来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}